# Scenario: presenter-1096-activation-condition&#xD;
&#xD;
## Header&#xD;
- scenario name: BehaviorSlot.activationCondition closed loop (config → compiled rule pair → RuleSystem → command → active mask → output)&#xD;
- build/version: local PresentationTests, real JSON config pipeline (PresenterDefinitionConfigLoader)&#xD;
- seed/map/clock: deterministic fixture / in-memory world / render dt 0.016s per step&#xD;
- execution timestamp: 2026-09-09T11:03:11.5750619+00:00&#xD;
&#xD;
## Timeline&#xD;
- [S001] 单位 A（VisualTransform=无）→ PresenterCreated&#xD;
- [S001] 单位 A → DeactivateBehavior（slot 6）&#xD;
- [S001] 单位 A → active mask=0x00000000，声音槽 不激活&#xD;
- [S001] 单位 A → 输出 不出现&#xD;
- [S002] 单位 B（VisualTransform=有）→ PresenterCreated&#xD;
- [S002] 单位 B → DeactivateBehavior（slot 6）&#xD;
- [S002] 单位 B → ActivateBehavior（slot 6）&#xD;
- [S002] 单位 B → active mask=0x00000040，声音槽 激活&#xD;
- [S002] 单位 B → 输出 出现（声音请求）&#xD;
&#xD;
## Outcome&#xD;
- success/failure decision: success&#xD;
- failed assertions: none&#xD;
- reason codes: condition_false_inactive, condition_true_active, flip_emits_deactivate_then_activate, mask_matches_condition&#xD;
&#xD;
## Summary Stats&#xD;
- DeactivateBehavior commands: 2 (unit A false + unit B reset)&#xD;
- ActivateBehavior commands: 1 (unit B true only)&#xD;
- slot under test: sound (index 6)&#xD;
